{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_mitm_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_mitm_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"白紙黑字","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_mitm_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"4e6e873bb8fa2f7a6a66f5e589238749b8860acc985cd3fe6f988cb33a7a7f58","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g1_kazdelroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下手一定要穩，聽到了沒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你最後一次機會，再失手你就別做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"垂頭喪氣的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對，就是這樣——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"垂頭喪氣的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是叫你手穩一點嗎，怎麼又劃壞了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"參考圖又不是沒有，你用鐵筆在蠟紙上原樣刻出來就可以了，這樣是有很難嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"垂頭喪氣的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顧問老大，我也不是故意的，真的是因為這上面的鬼畫符歪七扭八……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是字，“憑此券可享換物八折”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"垂頭喪氣的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道這是字，我也知道你要幫人印優惠券，但我不識字就是不識字……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我不跟你計較。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過報酬你也別想了，找你要賠償還差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"垂頭喪氣的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*薩卡茲粗口*，怎麼這樣！為什麼你自己不弄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有一大堆別的事情，怎麼可能天天坐在這裡刻蠟紙——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顧問老大，又有幫派在外面吵起來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"垂頭喪氣的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，雖然說你把蠟紙都用光了，看在你出了力的份上，自己去那袋馬鈴薯裡撿兩三個吧。別傳出去說我讓人幫我打白工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"垂頭喪氣的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？謝謝顧問老大！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莉絲，這次又是誰和誰吵？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是為了幾塊破石頭……他們就不能有點新意嗎？連勸架都一直說的是同樣台詞，我自己都煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，莉絲，來試試刻蠟紙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠟紙不是用光了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛，我剛想起來，自己弄到的蠟紙不是一包，是兩包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是是是，對對對。不過我才不試呢，我一看那些字啊紙啊的就頭痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還是不太懂，明明知道開不起報社，你幹嘛還弄一台油印機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些話我只告訴你，千萬別到處亂說。賣糧食的拜託我們印優惠券，拿著券只要四塊廢鐵就能換一袋馬鈴薯，這你知道吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……難道你想偷偷多印？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傻子才做這種自毀聲譽的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在廢鐵緊張，老闆的馬鈴薯又積壓了整整一地窖，所以他才願意印這種券。但我要幫他印的可不是“廢鐵換馬鈴薯”，而是“打八折”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哦！原來你想用別的換？木料嗎？我們這裡的木料也積壓著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就要看時價了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是顧問老大，看得就是遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我光是看得遠了，卻忘了自己身邊連個會寫字的人都找不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼一說，附近開了個識字班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"識字班？哦，你說的是那個僱傭兵吧。那傢伙一看就不好惹。他要是有哪位高徒出師了，我倒是可以考慮一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你別想了，去上課的都是比我還小好幾歲的小孩子，能乖乖坐著就不錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教小孩子？看來他就沒把這當混飯吃的工作……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，那他幹嘛要開班上課？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道，說不定是什麼遠大理想吧。我有個親戚家的孩子去上識字班，說老師經常講卡茲戴爾的文化啊未來啊什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣我更確定自己和他聊不來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還是自己刻蠟紙去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這小孩。我就說說而已，好不容易有這樣一個人，怎麼可能隨便放過他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，顧問老大認真起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顧問老大，所以你到底打算怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別吵，別吵，我在打草稿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請問赫德雷先生在嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷先生，初次見面，我叫珀耳，住的地方離您不遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"珀耳環視整個房間，顯眼的東西就只有一塊黑板，上面用粉筆寫著幾個最最基礎的句子，旁邊還有孩子們隨手畫的畫。\n再就是幾本書，看起來都很舊了。\n看著這些東西，珀耳更加確信自己剛剛打的草稿沒有問題，跟眼前這個人就得談這些。\n他刻意搓了搓手，暫時不去看赫德雷的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉不請自來，但我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實有一個理想。"},{"type":"narration","text":"珀耳這時再看向赫德雷的臉，眼前這個人沒顯出什麼值得關注的表情。\n這也難怪，珀耳想，這種願意坐冷板凳的人大多有點怪癖，或是乾脆就不太會說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我聽說您的理想……和我的其實一樣。您在辦識字班，正在教育卡茲戴爾的下一代，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這正是我的願景，一個人人識字的卡茲戴爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，我覺得赫德雷先生先我一步，已經在做一件很偉大的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甘願在小小的房間裡教活潑好動的孩子們，我真的很尊敬您。您是有遠大理想的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的文化已經遺失太久了，我們需要讓整個卡茲戴爾重新認識到文字、文化、文明對我們的重要性，而教育就是這一切的第一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但僅憑一個識字班，您的理想……很可能遭到埋沒。這可不是危言聳聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"口口相傳的東西終究會扭曲、消失，而我為此特意拼湊了一台油印機。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他眼睛亮了一下！這麼說有希望！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想想看，您口乾舌燥講上一個小時的東西，油印機幾秒鐘就能印出來，而且還能被更多人看見，這才是實現您理想的正路啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才想著來找您，想請您分出一些時間來幫忙刻蠟紙，為您的理想找一個更高的起點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來我自己也能刻蠟紙的，但是日常還有一些其他的工作，所以不是很方便——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你識字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對的，有些工作是需要識字才……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不對，我想說的不是這個，我是說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"才能讀得……不對，我們說的是刻蠟紙……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠟紙……蠟紙，蠟紙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，您剛剛問我的是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……“你識字”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是、是的，我識字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是父母教你的，還是老師？這個人還在卡茲戴爾嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我自學的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自學的？你很厲害。我已經很久沒在這附近看過認識字的薩卡茲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說，我也一樣，能見到您真的很開心，赫德雷先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到我們剛剛的話題，我是為了一個人人能識字的卡茲戴爾來找您的。開設識字班的您當然是厥功至偉，但——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛是說自己拼湊了一台油印機是嗎？現在正在印些什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時印些我自己覺得有用的東西，傳單，再來就是街區裡最近的消息之類的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人能看懂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的確會有一些問題，所以也印一些別的東西，比如優惠券什麼的。只要和賣糧食的手裡那張模板一模一樣，就算不認字也能用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，這麼做有點和我的理想背道而馳，但畢竟我一個人力量有限，所以才來找您——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛好相反，紙上的字能和貨物一起換糧食，能填飽肚子，這比什麼都有力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……力量？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷先生，和您聊天真的讓人受益良多。所以您看，來幫忙刻蠟紙的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有空我會去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛，偶爾刻刻蠟紙可能還不夠，我是真心實意想把印刷室辦起來的。我們能定個比較規律的時間嗎，比如每週來上幾個下午？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了識字班我還有別的事，抽不出太多時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷先生，這話不好聽，但我得說，為了理想，我們經常得……做出一些犧牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我覺得理想也不是光用時間就能衡量和決定的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不瞞您說，街區附近的幫派都知道我認字，我時不時就會被他們抓去讀東西，再不然就是叫我幫他們算數，誰賺了多少，誰虧了多少……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還是硬擠出時間開了這間印刷室，的確會犧牲一些空餘時間，但……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呃……這麼說不行。他看起來是真的沒時間。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，您要是有什麼識字班以外的事，我去幫您解決？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（苦笑）免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，現在無論如何也不能打退堂鼓，至少……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（對不起了，赫德雷先生。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"印刷室真的很缺人手，要是連您都幫不上忙，這個印刷室……我覺得可能要開不下去了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也真的是走投無路，又不想讓油印機白白放在那裡，所以才來找您的。要是連您也沒辦法幫我，那……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你現在無論如何都需要一名刻字工？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您實在是沒空，能不能想想別的辦法？為了這台油印機，我已經把自己存下來的積蓄花得分文不剩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您也知道的，那些幫派一點道理也不講，我幫他們打工，結果還倒欠他們的。要是開不了工，別說油印機，我怕是連住的地方都保不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這樣吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒等珀耳答話，赫德雷轉過身，去到房間一角，高大的身形擋住了手頭的動作。\n珀耳的心跳快了起來。\n這個人到底想拿什麼？一封信？一個地址？還是……武器？\n總不可能是錢——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些錢借給你，不急著還，慢慢來就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道錢在卡茲戴爾還不怎麼能花出去，但拿來應付那些幫派應該綽綽有餘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，你就拿剩下的錢，去雇一個人，去教那個人讀和寫，去讓這個街區再多一個識字的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不是，那些都好說，但這些錢是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和另一個人一起存下的。她存下的那部分我沒動，我存的這些應該就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您……您不怕我拿了錢就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呸！珀耳，你怎麼回事？錢馬上就到手了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就……收下了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，拿著吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"珀耳拿著錢愣在原地，而赫德雷走到他身邊，彎下腰，拍了拍他的肩膀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，你多大了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，不想說也沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想……你是自學的讀和寫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有家長，也沒有老師，得是什麼樣的生活，才能逼得一個孩子在卡茲戴爾早早學會了讀和寫啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快回去吧。等你教出了那位刻字工，記得把印出來的東西也給我一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷先生，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g1_kazdelroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顧問老大，你回來了啊。和那個僱傭兵聊得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼不說話？他不答應你就不答應啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他……沒有不答應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是更好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是你想的那樣，他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吞吞吐吐的，一點都不像你平常的樣子。難道你被他揍了一頓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要亂講。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說他有好多好多書，連你也不懂上面寫的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒那回事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——對了，書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莉絲，來幫我個忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是刻蠟紙的事？我都說了我不做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠟紙我來刻，你去我睡覺的地方，下面有個活板門，裡面有個木箱子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，我都不知道你還有這樣一個藏寶處！裡面是什麼好東西啊，珠寶，赤金？難道是薩科塔的守護銃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先去拿吧，拿到就知道了。我調調油印機。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好重，累死我了。顧問老大，這裡面到底是什麼啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鑰匙給你，你自己開。我一手油墨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你是真放心我啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你藏著這些破破爛爛的書幹什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸？這裡不是赫德雷先生的家嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珀耳嗎？進來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷先生，這些給您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……油印件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我印了幾份自己識字的時候用的書，您的識字班一定用得上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十幾年前的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，等孩子們學得深了一點之後，用來當閱讀材料剛好。讓我看看，僱傭兵的日記，萊塔尼亞入侵時軍事委員會印的心理戰傳單……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還真是什麼都有啊。這本看起來印的是1030年左右的手抄本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很珍貴嗎？需要的話，我幫您把原書籍拿過來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，有油印件就很好了。紙的錢怎麼算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼還能要您的錢！說句實話，就算把欠那些幫派的錢還了，我也用不了這麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是其中一半，您收好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珀耳——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您拿著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的一半您也不用擔心。不用幾個月，我就把這些錢還您，還附帶百分之十利息的那種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，利息就算了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別看我，你自己的錢，你自己決定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這樣……珀耳，這份地圖能不能幫我印一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題。還有別的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再想想……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，幫孩子們印點試卷？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g1_kazdelroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顧問老大，你看看這份蠟紙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……不錯不錯，差不多是個合格的刻字工了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是上面寫的東西，我只看得懂一半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別心急，我當年學讀寫也沒比你快多少。吃馬鈴薯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……加了糖的？顧問老大，你真好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可是我印刷室唯一一個刻字工，必須要好吃好喝伺候著嘛——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的幫派首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顧問老大，你來說說看，之前約好的四六分成，現在他們坐地起價要五五開，這事怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的幫派首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坐地起價？我的人傷了好幾個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吵得一點新意都沒有。顧問老大，我說得對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兩個幫派首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小孩子不懂事亂說的，別在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你們這件事也簡單。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"珀耳從桌子下面拿出一張印了字的紙，往桌子上一拍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是有約定書嘛，我這份手寫的，還幫你們各自印了一份，手印還在這裡呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看……“雙方四六分成”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的幫派首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，白紙黑字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“如果出現傷亡，傷亡輕的一方應適當讓出部分利益，最小限度為五五分成……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的幫派首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這才叫白紙黑字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的幫派首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*薩卡茲粗口*，顧問老大，你可別逼我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的幫派首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就你一個人識字，特地印了這東西打發我們，是不是就等著現在呢？真的以為自己說什麼就是什麼了？"},{"type":"narration","text":"珀耳咧嘴一笑，指了指房門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕被騙？那你們倒是自己去學啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離這裡不遠有個僱傭兵開的識字班，去那邊學兩天怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
